  CellName: Chum
  Description: 'Reef - intensity 2 of Chum: twelve shoals farther out, and the grazers eat them too.
    The standard 1200 u cell with its nucleus (~392 u). No environment prefab - the reef (12
    shoals, 768 prisms of 7 u, 0 of them shielded crust) is laid by ChumController. 9
    tameable tadpoles graze it outside the nucleus; 3 omni crystals respawn inside it (the
    scene''s CrystalManager). Frenzy sits 25% above the full arena (2,825 prisms, 433,138
    volume). Authored by Tools/Build/author_chum_assets.py - re-run it rather than
    hand-editing.'
